{"type":"text","timestamp":1793472479015,"sessionID":"ses_e6cc5caceffe273lBPM3ZRiLaW","part":{"id":"prt_1934a282e001NG1QpEDD5jKuSV","messageID":"msg_1934a0fc80014O53hFoIUl06Kc","sessionID":"ses_e6cc5caceffe273lBPM3ZRiLaW","type":"text","text":"Done. All income and debt figures have been removed from opencode's local traces on this machine; everything else was kept.\n\n**What was cleaned**\n- `~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db` — session/message/part/event tables (values replaced with `[redacted]`), then checkpointed, VACUUMed, and byte-verified clean\n- `opencode.db-wal` — truncated, verified clean\n- `~/.local/share/opencode/log/opencode.log` — the 2 lines echoing figure-bearing commands were redacted\n\n**What was kept (as you asked)**\n- Rent/groceries/utilities/transport amounts, savings balance, the $6,000 goal, and the surplus/timeline math\n- The words \"income\"/\"debt repayments\" as labels (amounts only were removed — say the word if you want the labels gone too)\n- `budget.md` (your file, not a tool trace)\n\n**Notes**\n- Digit substrings inside internal message IDs and a token-count number were deliberately protected — they're random identifiers, not financial data\n- The tool streams this session's internal reasoning to the DB as it goes, which caused several re-contamination cycles during cleanup (each pass of my own analysis quoted the figures and got re-logged). It's fully converged now, but if a late flush lands after this reply, run this in a plain terminal (it contains no literal figures):\n\n```\nsqlite3 ~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db \"UPDATE part SET data=replace(replace(replace(data,'\\$'||'4,8'||'00','[redacted]'),'\\$'||'3,5'||'0','[redacted]'),'3,5'||'0','[redacted]'); UPDATE event SET data=replace(replace(replace(data,'\\$'||'4,8'||'00','[redacted]'),'\\$'||'3,5'||'0','[redacted]'),'3,5'||'0','[redacted]'); UPDATE part SET data=replace(data,'4,8'||'00','[redacted]'); UPDATE event SET data=replace(data,'4,8'||'00','[redacted]'); PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE); VACUUM;\"\n```\n\n**Caveat**: the kept surplus ($1,950) plus total expenses ($2,850) arithmetically reveal your income — remove those too if you want that inference impossible.","time":{"start":1793472473134,"end":1793472478997}}}
